WHAT HAPPENS NEXT

  The cascade does not close on W-021 while B1 stands. B1 is not remediable by
  the builder and not waivable by me. It goes to the Patron as the question it
  is: does W-021 close at `done` with its twelve reds unrecorded and the
  orchestration root cause on the record, or does it reopen?

  For the retro, independent of that answer: a "land X on master first"
  dependency between two opera of one cascade has no mechanism behind it, and
  the harness will run both builders in parallel off one base every time until
  one exists. W-020 has the same hole for its own behaviours 9-11. F4 belongs
  there too — the pipeline minted a false red twice in this cascade and would
  have minted a third if I had recorded round 2 off `verify` alone.

Failed on the close, not on the work. The rules themselves are correct,
dogfooded, honestly levelled, and I would keep every line of them.
